<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">．晨检时间</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6:40-7:15</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">，请提前到岗到位；在门卫处领取额温枪和志愿者服装，结束时及时归还原处；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">．北门测温点</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在围墙东北角转弯处，测温点</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在地下停车场入口处，西门测温在道闸入口处。持额温枪进行测温</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>,</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">并检查教工个人健康码是否绿码；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt"><FONT face=Calibri> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">．体温监测过程中，如有温度异常者，按照之前培训的防疫流程进行操作，谨慎测温复核并第一时间联系校医处置；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
